1
00:00:54,359 --> 00:00:55,280
A face-to-face meeting?

2
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:56,679
Special Assistant Lin,

3
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:59,600
your Chairwoman Shen sure is well-informed.

4
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:00,880
What?

5
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:03,799
Seeing that I've almost cleared out Cloud Summit's floating shares,

6
00:01:04,159 --> 00:01:04,920
she can't sit still anymore?

7
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:06,000
Meet up?

8
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:06,680
Sure.

9
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,519
Tell Chairwoman Shen to bring her financial statements

10
00:01:08,519 --> 00:01:10,000
and line up at my rundown factory.

11
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:13,120
She expects me to go to Cloud Summit to see her?

12
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:14,519
Do I look stupid?

13
00:01:14,519 --> 00:01:15,560
Why would I walk into a trap?

14
00:01:17,519 --> 00:01:18,280
Hello?

15
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:19,599
Hello?

16
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,319
Special Assistant Lin?

17
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:23,480
Why did you stop talking?

18
00:01:24,439 --> 00:01:25,120
Hello?

19
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:27,799
I'm 22,

20
00:01:27,799 --> 00:01:29,319
1.83 meters tall,

21
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:30,480
with an eight-pack,

22
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:32,480
and in peak physical condition.

23
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:35,480
I can carry 50 kilos of fabric up five floors

24
00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:37,040
without even breaking a sweat.

25
00:01:37,439 --> 00:01:40,319
As long as you give our factory a mall storefront,

26
00:01:41,359 --> 00:01:43,920
my bottom line is flexible.

27
00:01:44,319 --> 00:01:47,439
She's actually using something so shameful as leverage!

28
00:01:47,599 --> 00:01:49,680
I can report downstairs to you anytime.

29
00:01:49,799 --> 00:01:52,280
If you think a black tank top is too plain,

30
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:55,359
our factory has leopard-print fabric in stock.

31
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,959
I can work the sewing machine overnight

32
00:01:57,959 --> 00:01:59,760
to make one for myself.

33
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,200
How do you have this recording?!

34
00:02:01,599 --> 00:02:02,239
Turn it off!

35
00:02:02,359 --> 00:02:03,359
Turn it off right now!

36
00:02:09,159 --> 00:02:09,879
Mr. Ma,

37
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:11,199
Chairwoman Shen says

38
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:13,479
this precious job application recording of yours

39
00:02:13,759 --> 00:02:15,120
would make a great ringback tone.

40
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,199
We're planning

41
00:02:16,199 --> 00:02:17,639
to turn it into Cloud Summit's

42
00:02:17,759 --> 00:02:18,759
hotline prompt.

43
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,319
Lin—Special Assistant Lin,

44
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:25,639
we're all business partners here,

45
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,400
in a working relationship.

46
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:30,199
There's no need for such dirty tricks.

47
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:31,800
Then...

48
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:33,080
tomorrow morning...

49
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,360
Tomorrow,

50
00:02:35,879 --> 00:02:37,080
I'll be there on time.

51
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,840
Chairwoman Shen?

52
00:02:47,879 --> 00:02:48,800
Don't tell me today...

53
00:02:49,319 --> 00:02:50,479
I'm really going to lose my virtue?

54
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:55,879
I'm here.

55
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:06,599
Chairwoman Shen?

56
00:03:09,879 --> 00:03:10,639
Chairwoman Shen?

57
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,240
Spicing things up, huh?

58
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:05,039
Second Master, Zhao Gang said on the phone

59
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,280
that his men saw with their own eyes

60
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,639
Chairwoman Shen's lover entering Cloud Summit.

61
00:04:07,879 --> 00:04:09,840
If we go now, we'll definitely catch them in the act.

62
00:04:16,879 --> 00:04:18,079
Name your terms.

63
00:04:18,839 --> 00:04:20,839
I just want my voice recorder back.

64
00:04:27,759 --> 00:04:28,759
Money is fine,

65
00:04:28,759 --> 00:04:29,519
but don't expect my body.

66
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,279
Let's talk this through.

67
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,399
First, get off me.

68
00:04:36,759 --> 00:04:37,879
Not selling your body, huh?

69
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:41,319
But in that phone recording of yours,

70
00:04:41,319 --> 00:04:42,800
that's not what you said.

71
00:04:45,759 --> 00:04:46,800
Wait, your voice...

72
00:04:48,199 --> 00:04:49,160
Why does it sound so familiar?

73
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:55,560
Sister Yiyi?

74
00:05:00,439 --> 00:05:01,240
What are you doing here?

75
00:05:01,639 --> 00:05:02,360
What?

76
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:03,519
Disappointed?

77
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,199
Ridiculous!

78
00:05:06,639 --> 00:05:07,519
Are you crazy?

79
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:08,399
This is

80
00:05:09,199 --> 00:05:10,000
Cloud Summit!

81
00:05:10,839 --> 00:05:11,319
Wearing some stupid mask

82
00:05:11,319 --> 00:05:12,759
to play some kinky roleplay with me?

83
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:14,839
You're driving me crazy!

84
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,319
Wait a second.

85
00:05:18,199 --> 00:05:19,240
How did you even sneak in here?

86
00:05:20,319 --> 00:05:21,519
Answer me first.

87
00:05:21,639 --> 00:05:22,879
Cloud Summit's shares...

88
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:25,959
Director Xu is here!

89
00:05:39,639 --> 00:05:40,519
Director Xu, Director Xu!

90
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:47,040
Second Uncle, what brings you here?

91
00:05:55,439 --> 00:05:55,959
I heard

92
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:57,959
you canceled two important meetings today

93
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:59,560
and specifically chose this conference room.

94
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,199
I came by to see

95
00:06:01,519 --> 00:06:03,439
just what kind of powerful VIP

96
00:06:03,439 --> 00:06:05,839
had my nephew's wife making such a fuss.

97
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,000
What?

98
00:06:09,199 --> 00:06:10,160
Has the VIP left already?

99
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:15,800
Lately, someone's been attempting a hostile takeover of the company's stock.

100
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,920
I scheduled a meeting with legal about Cloud Summit,

101
00:06:18,519 --> 00:06:19,639
but he got stuck in traffic,

102
00:06:19,639 --> 00:06:20,839
so we pushed it to the afternoon.

103
00:06:21,879 --> 00:06:22,560
Oh?

104
00:06:23,199 --> 00:06:25,600
Does meeting with legal require all this now?

105
00:06:29,959 --> 00:06:30,879
Second Uncle,

106
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,319
it's a misunderstanding.

107
00:06:32,439 --> 00:06:32,839
I...

108
00:06:39,959 --> 00:06:40,720
Jialing,

109
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,439
ever since my nephew passed away,

110
00:06:42,439 --> 00:06:44,639
you've held up Cloud Summit alone all these years.

111
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:47,279
I've seen the group's growth over these past two years.

112
00:06:47,519 --> 00:06:48,959
For Cloud Summit to achieve what it has today,

113
00:06:49,319 --> 00:06:50,120
I'm truly gratified.

114
00:06:50,439 --> 00:06:51,240
I respect you,

115
00:06:52,079 --> 00:06:54,160
and I deeply appreciate you as my nephew's wife.

116
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,600
There are some things

117
00:06:58,199 --> 00:06:59,360
your second uncle probably shouldn't say,

118
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,879
but I simply have to say them.

119
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:02,360
I understand.

120
00:07:03,279 --> 00:07:04,240
You're still young,

121
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,920
and life as a widow isn't easy.

122
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:08,879
If, during this time, you're out there

123
00:07:08,879 --> 00:07:10,920
looking for company to pass the time,

124
00:07:11,079 --> 00:07:12,040
I can understand that.

125
00:07:14,279 --> 00:07:16,399
The Xu family isn't unreasonable.

126
00:07:17,399 --> 00:07:18,120
Of course,

127
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:20,279
if among those men

128
00:07:21,199 --> 00:07:22,800
you find someone suitable,

129
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,279
and you wish to remarry,

130
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,319
the Xu family won't stop you.

131
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,560
I could even prepare

132
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,600
a generous dowry for you.

133
00:07:30,759 --> 00:07:32,000
But if that happens,

134
00:07:33,839 --> 00:07:35,600
there will be no place for you at Cloud Summit.

135
00:07:36,439 --> 00:07:37,480
You must realize,

136
00:07:37,959 --> 00:07:38,920
Cloud Summit...

137
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:41,120
can only bear the name Xu.

138
00:07:42,279 --> 00:07:43,600
It can never bear the name Shen.

139
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:46,079
You're a smart woman.

140
00:07:46,519 --> 00:07:47,800
You know what I mean.

141
00:07:49,839 --> 00:07:50,439
Second Uncle,

142
00:07:51,319 --> 00:07:52,959
Cloud Summit is all I care about.

143
00:07:59,879 --> 00:08:01,120
I believe what you say.

144
00:08:02,839 --> 00:08:04,279
But how can you guarantee that,

145
00:08:04,279 --> 00:08:05,680
if you remarry one day,

146
00:08:06,399 --> 00:08:08,279
you'll still keep Cloud Summit

147
00:08:09,279 --> 00:08:10,399
as your top priority?

148
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:12,040
Even if I remarry, I'll still—

149
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:12,800
Unless...

150
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,439
this person is handpicked by me.

151
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,199
How about this?

152
00:08:21,279 --> 00:08:22,360
Let me make the call for once.

153
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,240
Let me introduce someone to you.

154
00:08:25,319 --> 00:08:26,839
In terms of character

155
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:27,959
as well as good looks,

156
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,600
this young man is quite decent.

157
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,439
Especially in business,

158
00:08:31,439 --> 00:08:32,639
he has a unique eye.

159
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:33,320
What's more,

160
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,320
when it comes to the stock market,

161
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:37,120
he has sharp instincts.

162
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:38,440
If

163
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:40,080
the two of you can get together,

164
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,279
I believe within three years—no,

165
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:43,639
in just one year—

166
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,559
Cloud Summit's market value

167
00:08:46,799 --> 00:08:48,159
will definitely double!

168
00:08:48,799 --> 00:08:50,039
For Cloud Summit's sake,

169
00:08:50,039 --> 00:08:50,879
I hope

170
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,720
you can make a small sacrifice.

171
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:55,120
You must help me win him over.

172
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,320
If necessary,

173
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:58,960
you can seduce him.

174
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:01,840
Seduce him?!

175
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,519
Who on earth could make Sister Yiyi,

176
00:09:05,519 --> 00:09:07,440
a woman who fears nothing in this world,

177
00:09:07,879 --> 00:09:09,279
turn so pale with fright?

178
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:13,879
I get it.

179
00:09:15,039 --> 00:09:17,639
Director Xu is a top executive at Cloud Summit,

180
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:19,919
and Sister Yiyi is his woman.

181
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,720
No wonder

182
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:24,840
I always run into her at Cloud Summit,

183
00:09:26,519 --> 00:09:28,159
and Sister Linna even let her wear a mask

184
00:09:28,159 --> 00:09:29,399
to fool around in the conference room.

185
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,279
It turns out it's all because

186
00:09:31,279 --> 00:09:33,240
she has this big shot backing her up!

187
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:37,360
She's always so bossy in front of me,

188
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:40,240
but she's actually terrified of being caught red-handed by her man!

189
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,320
Second Uncle,

190
00:09:43,799 --> 00:09:44,919
I'm your nephew's wife.

191
00:09:44,919 --> 00:09:45,759
You want me to—

192
00:09:47,399 --> 00:09:48,879
What about the Xu family's dignity?

193
00:09:50,159 --> 00:09:51,240
What about our family rules?

194
00:09:52,279 --> 00:09:54,360
Don't get so worked up over this.

195
00:09:54,759 --> 00:09:56,000
Aren't rules made by people anyway?

196
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:56,720
Besides,

197
00:09:57,759 --> 00:09:58,679
the Xu family's dignity—

198
00:09:58,679 --> 00:09:59,639
can it put food on the table?

199
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,279
Can it make our stock hit limit-up?

200
00:10:02,519 --> 00:10:04,840
I only have your best interests at heart.

201
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:05,879
Think about it.

202
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:06,639
Tell you what,

203
00:10:06,799 --> 00:10:07,919
in a couple of days,

204
00:10:08,639 --> 00:10:09,600
I'll arrange for you two to meet.

205
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:11,679
Second Unc—

206
00:10:19,679 --> 00:10:20,279
Pervert!
